  "reasoning": "The defendant 鞠某 promised high monthly interest rates to obtain large sums of money from many individuals, fabricated business purposes, used the funds for personal expenses, and failed to repay the principal and interest. This conduct constitutes fraudulent fundraising with the intent of illegal gain, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as ‘集资诈骗罪’ (fraudulent fundraising). No other distinct crimes are indicated in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]集资诈骗罪<eoa>"
}
